            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seleccionado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the button that reveals an item in Finder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mostrar en Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop" : {
      "comment" : "Button that cancels a scan in progress.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detener"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Trash was emptied for good, then %lld items moved to it. Empty it again to reclaim their space." : {
      "comment" : "Summary after a cleanup that emptied the Trash and then moved other items to it. The argument is the number of items moved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "The Trash was emptied for good, then %lld item moved to it. Empty it again to reclaim its space."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "The Trash was emptied for good, then %lld items moved to it. Empty it again to reclaim their space."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "La Papelera se vació para siempre y después se movió %lld elemento a ella. Vacíala de nuevo para recuperar su espacio."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "La Papelera se vació para siempre y después se movieron %lld elementos a ella. Vacíala de nuevo para recuperar su espacio."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Trash was emptied for good." : {
      "comment" : "Summary after a cleanup that emptied the Trash.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Papelera se vació para siempre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then the other items, which take up %@, go to the Trash, where you can put them back." : {
      "comment" : "Second part of the message of the dialog that asks before emptying the Trash and then moving other items to it. The argument is a size, such as “1.2 GB”.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después, los demás elementos, que ocupan %@, van a la Papelera. Puedes recuperarlos desde allí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They take up %@. You can put them back from the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the dialog that asks before moving items to the Trash. The argument is a size, such as “1.2 GB”.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ocupan %@. Puedes recuperarlos desde la Papelera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protects this item. Move it to the Trash yourself in Finder, or give CleanMac Full Disk Access and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Why an item couldn't be moved to the Trash: macOS protects it, such as another app's container.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS protege este elemento. Muévelo tú a la Papelera desde Finder, o da a CleanMac acceso total al disco y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
